  "name": "Ultimate Aegis",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/magic/holy/barrier-shield-winged-cross.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 15th level, your Aegis has reached its peak performance. It gains the following benefits:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you have already used your reaction to use either your Fortification Zone or Dauntless Design features, you can choose to gain another reaction to use those features again for that round. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Intelligence modifier, regaining all uses back on a long rest.</li>\n<li>Any creature you have shoved while wielding your Aegis is knocked back 15ft instead of 5ft. Additionally, you count as two sizes larger when it comes to shoving.</li>\n</ul>",
